    card title "My day"

A: How do you tell someone about your day in Russian: when you get up, eat, work and sleep?
    draw seg_m seg_d seg_e seg_n

    draw numerals parallel true

A: Here's a day, from six in the morning round to six the next. Masha takes us through hers.
    blocking false

    highlight num_0 effect circle color #3d3833 duration 2

    highlight num_4 effect circle color #3d3833 duration 2.2

    draw ev_alarm dot7 parallel true

B: У́тром я встаю́ в семь часо́в.
    draw s1

    draw noun_m lab_m

A: У́тро is morning, and in the morning is у́тром: the ом of ле́том and с молоко́м, with no в.
    blocking false

    highlight noun_m effect underline color #c9871a duration 1.6

    highlight lab_m part ом effect circle color #3d3833 duration 3

A: Встаю́ is I get up, and в семь часо́в, at seven, is from lesson twenty-six.
    blocking false

    highlight s1_w_3 effect underline color #c9871a duration 1.8

    highlight s1_w_4 s1_w_5 s1_w_6 effect underline color #c9871a duration 2.4

A: Its dictionary form is встава́ть, but the present drops the ва: я встаю́, ты встаёшь.
    draw n_vst

    erase s1 n_vst ev_alarm

    draw ev_coffee dot8 parallel true

B: Пото́м я за́втракаю.
    draw s2

A: Пото́м means then: it moves the day along. And за́втракаю is I have breakfast.
    highlight s2 effect underline color #c9871a part Пото́м

    draw n_tom

A: Mind the к: за́втра is tomorrow, but за́втрак is breakfast.
    draw n_bre

    highlight n_bre part к effect circle color #3d3833 duration 1.2

    erase s2 n_tom n_bre ev_coffee

    draw ev_work dot15 parallel true

B: Днём я рабо́таю.
    draw s3

    draw noun_d lab_d

A: День is day, so in the daytime is днём: the е drops out, and ом becomes ём.
    blocking false

    highlight noun_d effect underline color #c9871a duration 1.8

    highlight lab_d part ём effect circle color #3d3833 duration 3

    erase s3 ev_work

    draw ev_lunch dot13 parallel true

B: В час я обе́даю.
    draw s4

A: Обе́д is lunch, so обе́даю is I have lunch, and в час is at one: just час, as in lesson twenty-six.
    highlight s4 effect underline color #c9871a part обе́даю

    erase s4 ev_lunch

    draw noun_e

A: Next comes ве́чер, the evening. Before Masha says it: how would you say in the evening?
    blocking false

    highlight noun_e effect underline color #c9871a duration 1.8

    highlight seg_e duration 3

    quiz "Pick the word for in the evening." store chk reveal.text ве́чером reveal.at.x 605 reveal.at.y 440 reveal.style label reveal.size 56 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b
        right: Ве́чером: ом, as in у́тром, and no в.
        wrong: Think of у́тром: it takes an ending, and no в.
        * в ве́чер
        + ве́чером
        * ве́чер

    erase chk_stamp

    draw lab_e ev_dinner dot20 parallel true

B: Ве́чером я у́жинаю в во́семь часо́в.
    draw s5

    erase s5 ev_dinner

A: Look at the three meals: за́втрак, обе́д, and у́жин, the dinner of lesson twenty-six.
    draw t_nouns

A: Add аю, the ending of чита́ю, and each one becomes a verb for eating it: за́втракаю, обе́даю, у́жинаю.
    draw t_verbs

B: And with ты, it's ешь: ты у́жинаешь.
    draw t_ty

    erase table

    draw ev_sleep dot26 parallel true

B: Но́чью я сплю.
    draw s6

    draw noun_n lab_n

A: Ночь is night, and at night is но́чью, with the ью of о́сенью. Сплю is simply I sleep.
    blocking false

    highlight noun_n effect underline color #c9871a duration 1.6

    highlight lab_n part ью effect circle color #3d3833 duration 2.2

    highlight s6_w_3 effect underline color #c9871a duration 1.8

    erase s6 ev_sleep

B: So the parts of the day work like the seasons: у́тром, днём and ве́чером like ле́том, но́чью like о́сенью, and no в.
    blocking false

    highlight lab_m part ом effect underline color #c9871a duration 1.3

    highlight lab_d part ём effect underline color #c9871a duration 1.3

    highlight lab_e part ом effect underline color #c9871a duration 1.3

    highlight lab_n part ью effect underline color #c9871a duration 1.3

    hide strip labels nouns numerals dots

B: Now I ask Tom about his day.
    draw tom tom_name masha masha_name parallel true

    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"b","text":"Том, когда́ ты встаёшь?","gloss":"Tom, when do you get up?"},{"by":"a","text":"В де́сять часо́в.","gloss":"At ten o'clock."},{"by":"b","text":"А когда́ ты рабо́таешь?","gloss":"And when do you work?"},{"by":"a","text":"Ве́чером, в рестора́не.","gloss":"In the evening, at the restaurant."}] size 1.3

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

B: My questions used ты, with ешь: встаёшь, рабо́таешь.
    blocking false

    highlight talk_1_words part встаёшь effect underline color #c9871a duration 1.8

    highlight talk_3_words part рабо́таешь effect underline color #c9871a duration 1.8

    erase talk

    dialogue talk2 speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"b","text":"А когда́ ты у́жинаешь?","gloss":"And when do you have dinner?"},{"by":"a","text":"Но́чью!","gloss":"At night!"}] size 1.3

    draw talk2

A: I work in the evening, so my dinner comes at night.
    highlight talk2_2_words effect underline color #c9871a

    erase talk2

    hide speakers

    icon t1_pic size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["teacup without handle"] icon_look picture of "hot beverage"

    quiz "Say: in the morning I have breakfast. Pick one." above t1_pic store q1 reveal.text "У́тром я за́втракаю." reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: У́тром, with the when-ending and no в.
        wrong: In the morning is one word, with no в.
        * У́тро я за́втракаю.
        * В у́тро я за́втракаю.
        + У́тром я за́втракаю.

    pause 1.2

    erase t1_pic q1_stamp

    icon t2_pic size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["night with stars"] icon_look picture of "crescent moon"

    ask "Type the Russian for at night." above t2_pic answer ["ночью"] store q2 default но́чью reveal.text Но́чью reveal.style label reveal.size 80 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Но́чью: ночь with the ью of о́сенью.
        wrong: Start from ночь and add the ending of о́сенью.

    pause 1.2

    erase t2_pic q2_stamp

    icon t3_pic size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["green salad","bento box"] icon_look picture of sandwich

    quiz "Днём я … в час. Which verb means I have lunch?" above t3_pic store q3 reveal.text "Днём я обе́даю в час." reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Обе́д is lunch, so обе́даю.
        wrong: At one in the daytime: which meal is that?
        + обе́даю
        * у́жинаю
        * за́втракаю

    pause 1.2

    erase t3_pic q3_stamp

    icon t4_pic size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["mantelpiece clock"] icon_look picture of "alarm clock"

    quiz "Ask Tom when he gets up: Когда́ ты … ?" above t4_pic store q4 reveal.text "Когда́ ты встаёшь?" reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Ты takes ешь, here with ё: встаёшь.
        wrong: Встаю́ is for я, and встаёт for он.
        * встаю́
        * встаёт
        + встаёшь

    pause 1.2

    erase t4_pic q4_stamp

    icon t5_pic size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["spaghetti","fork and knife with plate"] icon_look picture of "pot of food"

    quiz "Masha had dinner at seven yesterday. Pick her words." above t5_pic store q5 reveal.text "Вчера́ я у́жинала." reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Like чита́ла: у́жина, then ла for Masha: у́жинала.
        wrong: Yesterday needs the past, and Masha is a she.
        * Вчера́ я у́жинаю в семь часо́в.
        + Вчера́ я у́жинала в семь часо́в.
        * Вчера́ я у́жинал в семь часо́в.

    pause 1.2

    erase t5_pic q5_stamp

    show strip labels numerals dots

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    text cue_meal "за́втрак → за́втракаю" #3d3833 say за́втракаю say_voice b colors {"аю$":"#3d8a5a"} x 330 y 470 font_size 44
    text cue_potom "пото́м" #3d3833 say true say_voice b x 760 y 470 font_size 44
    parallel true

A: So a day in Russian runs on a few small pieces: у́тром, днём, ве́чером, но́чью for when, a meal plus аю for eating it, and пото́м to go on.
    blocking false

    highlight lab_m color #c9871a effect underline duration 1.3

    highlight lab_d color #c9871a effect underline duration 1.3

    highlight lab_e color #c9871a effect underline duration 1.3

    highlight lab_n color #c9871a effect underline duration 1.3

    highlight cue_meal part аю effect underline color #c9871a duration 1.8

    highlight cue_potom effect underline color #c9871a duration 1.8

B: Э́то мой день. And yours? Next time, what to say when you feel ill. Пока́!
    text e_line "Э́то мой день." #3d3833 say true say_voice b x 500 y 560 font_size 64

